* text=auto

# The interoperability fixtures are byte-exact artefacts. Every evidence id and
# every signature Topgent has written is a digest over bytes of this shape, and
# a checkout that rewrote a line ending would change them.
#
# Found by CI on 2026-09-03: both Windows jobs failed the pinned-bundle test
# while macOS and Linux passed, because git had turned each LF into CRLF on
# checkout. The test was right and the storage was wrong. Later rules win in
# this file, so this one has to sit below the catch-all above.
crates/topgent-evidence/tests/fixtures/** -text
